WEBVTT

00:06:29.076 --> 00:06:33.314
and in that consuming,
which can take months, weeks, years,

00:06:33.338 --> 00:06:35.559
the idea is interviewing you
and asking you,

00:06:35.583 --> 00:06:37.838
"Do you want to do this thing
with me or not?"

00:06:37.862 --> 00:06:42.269
And that's the most important conversation
that I think human beings can have,

00:06:42.293 --> 00:06:48.089
is that dialogue between
your willingness to cooperate and show up

00:06:48.113 --> 00:06:50.729
and make something
with this idea and manifest it

00:06:50.753 --> 00:06:52.705
and the idea's desire to be made

00:06:52.729 --> 00:06:55.670
and the question of whether
you are indeed the right partner.

00:06:55.694 --> 00:06:58.272
And my feeling is, when you say no,

00:06:58.296 --> 00:07:01.309
it just moves around
and looks for somebody else,